 "stop": "3 quatrains",
 "poem": "I thought I had seen the darkness\nThrough some small window of darkness,\nBut was startled by darkness\nI could not see--or believe.\nI saw, but did not understand,\nIt was a great sea beneath;\nAnd none knew where it shortly\nHad come from; nor why again;\nAnd which it were nowhere;\nFor never a thought arose\nTo be sure of my life again.\nO that they might understand",
